{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetExists"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau.isRowStandard_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau.isRowStandard_one","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionTableau.lean#L94-L98","doc":"**The reference tableau `t^μ` is row standard.**  It is the identity: entry `a` sits\nin cell `a`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau.existsUnique_rowStandard","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau.existsUnique_rowStandard","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionTableau.lean#L81-L92","doc":"**Mathas, Proposition 3.3, in tableau language.**  Every right coset of the Young\nsubgroup `S_μ` contains **exactly one row-standard `μ`-tableau**.\n\nThis reproves nothing: it is `existsUnique_isDistinguished_mem_coset` read through\n`isRowStandard_iff_isDistinguished`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau.isRowStandard_iff_isDistinguished","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau.isRowStandard_iff_isDistinguished","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionTableau.lean#L59-L79","doc":"**The dictionary.**  A tableau is row standard exactly when its carrying permutation\nis distinguished — the cell-side and entry-side conditions are the same condition, because\na bijection is monotone within a block iff its inverse is. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau.IsRowStandard","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau.IsRowStandard","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionTableau.lean#L54-L57","doc":"**Row standardness**, stated on cells: along each row, taken in increasing cell\norder, the entries increase. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau.rowAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau.rowAt","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionTableau.lean#L51-L52","doc":"**The row of cell `x`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau.entryAt_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau.entryAt_apply","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionTableau.lean#L48-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau.entryAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionTableau.entryAt","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionTableau.lean#L44-L46","doc":"**The entry in cell `x`**, for the tableau carried by `d` in the entry ↦ cell\norientation. ","signatureChunk":0}]}